==Introduction==

===Abstract===

This ELIP proposes two new opcodes for Elements, <code>OP_SHRINCS</code> (<code>0xb3</code>) and <code>OP_SHRINCSADD</code> (<code>0xb4</code>), which verify [https://github.com/SHRINCS/shrincs-bip SHRINCS] signatures. The opcodes work in P2WSH outputs, in tapscript and in the block signing script. The document also defines the <code>headers2</code> message, which nodes need once block headers carry SHRINCS signatures. The change requires a hard fork.

