| <code><nowiki>OP_8 OP_PICK (nine times) <K1> OP_SHRINCS OP_VERIFY <K1> OP_SHRINCS</nowiki></code> || <code>W1</code> || tapscript || <code>SCRIPT_ERR_TAPSCRIPT_VALIDATION_WEIGHT</code>: a budget of 763, two charges of 421
|-
| <code><nowiki><73> OP_PICK (74 times) <K2> OP_SHRINCS OP_VERIFY <K2> OP_SHRINCS</nowiki></code> || <code>W3</code> || witness v0, block context || <code>SCRIPT_ERR_TAPSCRIPT_VALIDATION_WEIGHT</code>: a budget of 6,229, two charges of 4,443
|}

The block context vector uses the message of vector 3. The others use the message of vector 1 where they verify a signature. In witness v0 the budget is the serialized size of the witness and the script, plus 50. The tapscript budget assumes a tree with a single leaf, so it also counts a control block of 33 bytes.

==Reference Implementation==

The reference implementation is the branch <code>feature/sync_shrincs_with_elements_29x</code> of [https://github.com/ElementsProject/elements-pq/tree/feature/sync_shrincs_with_elements_29x ElementsProject/elements-pq].

